    "A gentle buzz when your HRV drops while your heart rate is calm: a cue to take a paced breath. Rate-limited to once every 15 minutes; off by default." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A gentle buzz when your HRV drops while your heart rate is calm: a cue to take a paced breath. Rate-limited to once every 15 minutes; off by default."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un zumbido suave cuando tu HRV baja mientras tu pulso está en calma, una señal para respirar con calma. Limitado a una vez cada 15 minutos; apagado por defecto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A gentle wrist buzz when you've been sitting a long stretch, so you remember to get up and walk. Sitting less through the day is linked to better long-term health, independent of your workouts." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un zumbido suave en la muñeca cuando llevas mucho rato sentado, para que te acuerdes de levantarte y caminar. Estar menos tiempo sentado a lo largo del día se asocia con mejor salud a largo plazo, independiente de tu entrenamiento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A gentler drop than a deep-rest night usually shows. It's a pattern, not a diagnosis." : {
