    "Each bar counts the WORK sets that loaded that muscle as a primary mover, averaged per week over the selected span. Warm-ups don't count." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each bar counts the WORK sets that loaded that muscle as a primary mover, averaged per week over the selected span. Warm-ups don't count."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada barra cuenta las series de TRABAJO que cargaron ese músculo como principal, promediadas por semana en el rango elegido. Los calentamientos no cuentan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each cell is a day · greener = higher adherence. Tap a day to view it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each cell is a day · greener = higher adherence. Tap a day to view it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada celda es un día · más verde = más apego. Toca un día para verlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each night your Apple Watch records skin temperature. We compare it with a rolling baseline of your own recent nights and report the difference in °C: so the value is always relative to you, not an absolute temperature. The trend and the spread are computed from that same nightly deviation." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each night your Apple Watch records skin temperature. We compare it with a rolling baseline of your own recent nights and report the difference in °C: so the value is always relative to you, not an absolute temperature. The trend and the spread are computed from that same nightly deviation."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada noche tu Apple Watch registra la temperatura de tu piel. La comparamos con una línea base móvil de tus noches recientes y reportamos la diferencia en °C: así el valor siempre es relativo a ti, no una temperatura absoluta. La tendencia y la dispersión se calculan de esa misma desviación por noche."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each night's deviation · the band is your typical swing (±your variation) · 0 is your baseline." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each night's deviation · the band is your typical swing (±your variation) · 0 is your baseline."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Desviación de cada noche · la banda es tu vaivén típico (±tu variación) · 0 es tu base."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each second of heart rate is mapped to one of five intensity zones; time in the higher zones counts for much more. The weighted total is compressed onto a 0–21 scale through a logarithmic curve, so the top of the scale represents a theoretical full day at peak intensity." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each second of heart rate is mapped to one of five intensity zones; time in the higher zones counts for much more. The weighted total is compressed onto a 0–21 scale through a logarithmic curve, so the top of the scale represents a theoretical full day at peak intensity."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada segundo de frecuencia cardiaca se asigna a una de cinco zonas de intensidad; el tiempo en las zonas altas cuenta mucho más. El total ponderado se comprime a una escala de 0 a 21 con una curva logarítmica, así que el tope representa un día entero teórico a intensidad máxima."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each session is a workout from Apple Health, an on-device capture, or a manual entry. The count and totals follow the range you pick above (widened if that range is empty)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each session is a workout from Apple Health, an on-device capture, or a manual entry. The count and totals follow the range you pick above (widened if that range is empty)."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada sesión es un entrenamiento de Apple Salud, una captura en el dispositivo o una entrada manual. El conteo y los totales siguen el rango que eliges arriba (se amplía si ese rango está vacío)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each session saves its receipt. Open them to reprint or share." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada sesión guarda su recibo. Ábrelos para reimprimir o compartir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each set adds load to the muscles it works, decaying by half every two days: the time course of muscle protein synthesis (MacDougall 1995; Damas 2015). Color is relative to your most-loaded muscle, so it reads which of your muscles are hot right now. Weekly volume is judged against the 10–20 sets-per-week band (Schoenfeld 2017), a hypertrophy guide per muscle group; the volume shown is weighted by involvement, so secondary muscles count less. The recommendation crosses this with your recovery: a low-recovery day gates everything to rest." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each set adds load to the muscles it works, decaying by half every two days: the time course of muscle protein synthesis (MacDougall 1995; Damas 2015). Color is relative to your most-loaded muscle, so it reads which of your muscles are hot right now. Weekly volume is judged against the 10–20 sets-per-week band (Schoenfeld 2017), a hypertrophy guide per muscle group; the volume shown is weighted by involvement, so secondary muscles count less. The recommendation crosses this with your recovery: a low-recovery day gates everything to rest."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada serie suma carga a los músculos que trabaja y decae a la mitad cada dos días: el curso temporal de la síntesis de proteína muscular (MacDougall 1995; Damas 2015). El color es relativo a tu músculo más cargado, así que lee cuáles de tus músculos están calientes ahora. El volumen semanal se juzga contra la banda de 10–20 series por semana (Schoenfeld 2017), una guía de hipertrofia por grupo muscular; el volumen mostrado está ponderado por involucramiento, así que los músculos secundarios cuentan menos. La recomendación lo cruza con tu recuperación: un día de recuperación baja lo manda todo a descanso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each set loads the muscles it works and fades by half every 2 days · " : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each set loads the muscles it works and fades by half every 2 days · "
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada serie carga los músculos que trabaja y decae a la mitad cada 2 días · "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each signal becomes a score of how far above or below your personal average it sits (a z-score, in σ). They're averaged with fixed weights, HRV 60%, resting heart rate 20%, sleep 15%, skin temperature 10%, respiration 5%, and mapped onto a 0–100 scale, calibrated so a typical day lands near 58. If a signal is missing on a given night, its weight is shared among the others." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each signal becomes a score of how far above or below your personal average it sits (a z-score, in σ). They're averaged with fixed weights, HRV 60%, resting heart rate 20%, sleep 15%, skin temperature 10%, respiration 5%, and mapped onto a 0–100 scale, calibrated so a typical day lands near 58. If a signal is missing on a given night, its weight is shared among the others."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada señal se convierte en un puntaje de qué tan por arriba o por abajo de tu promedio personal quedó (un z-score, en σ). Se promedian con pesos fijos, HRV 60%, FC en reposo 20%, sueño 15%, temperatura de la piel 10%, respiración 5%, y se mapean a una escala de 0 a 100, calibrada para que un día típico caiga cerca de 58. Si una señal falta una noche, su peso se reparte entre las demás."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each signal becomes a score of how far above or below your personal average it sits (a z-score, in σ). They're combined with the weights shown and mapped onto a 0–100 scale through a logistic curve, calibrated so a typical day lands near 58. It's an estimate, not a diagnosis." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each signal becomes a score of how far above or below your personal average it sits (a z-score, in σ). They're combined with the weights shown and mapped onto a 0–100 scale through a logistic curve, calibrated so a typical day lands near 58. It's an estimate, not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada señal se convierte en una medida de qué tan por encima o por debajo de tu promedio personal está (un z-score, en σ). Se combinan con los pesos mostrados y se llevan a una escala de 0 a 100 con una curva logística, calibrada para que un día típico caiga cerca de 58. Es una estimación, no un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ease" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
