      }
    },
    "I have read and accept these terms, and I'm using Cénit with my own device and my own data, at my own risk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "He leído y acepto estos términos, y uso Cénit con mi propio dispositivo y mis propios datos, bajo mi propio riesgo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I haven't found clear links yet. They'll show up here as soon as I see them." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todavía no encuentro vínculos claros. Aparecerán aquí en cuanto los vea."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I need about two weeks of data to reveal your first pattern with confidence." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Necesito unas dos semanas de datos para revelarte tu primer patrón con confianza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I need at least 3 signals to work this out without guessing. You have %@." : {
      "comment" : "A message in the hero when the Body Age reading is not yet available.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "I need at least 3 signals to work this out without guessing. You have %lld." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I need at least 3 signals to work this out without guessing. You have %lld."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Necesito al menos 3 señales para calcularla sin adivinar. Llevas %lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I need several weeks of nights with your band on to read the rhythm of your temperature. Still watching." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Necesito varias semanas de noches con tu banda puesta para leer el ritmo de tu temperatura. Sigo observando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I spotted a hunch in your data. Try it 7 nights and I'll tell you if it's real for you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vi una corazonada en tus datos. Pruébalo 7 noches y te digo si es real para ti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I understand this is a rough estimate to know myself better, not a contraceptive method or a medical tool." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Entiendo que es una estimación aproximada para conocerme mejor, no un método anticonceptivo ni una herramienta médica."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'll stop estimating your phase. Your temperature data and everything else stay the same." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dejo de estimar tu fase. Tus datos de temperatura y todo lo demás se quedan igual."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm learning your pattern." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estoy aprendiendo tu patrón."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm still learning how your body works." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aún estoy aprendiendo cómo funciona tu cuerpo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm still learning your rhythm: I need a few days of waking readings to mark your peaks. Your events are already here." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I'm still learning your rhythm: I need a few days of waking readings to mark your peaks. Your events are already here."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aún estoy aprendiendo tu ritmo, necesito unos días de lecturas de vigilia para marcar tus picos. Tus eventos ya están aquí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm still learning your rhythm. A few more nights and the read sharpens." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
