    "It didn't hold up this time." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se sostuvo esta vez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It doesn't detect disease." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It doesn't detect disease."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No detecta enfermedades."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It doesn't diagnose pregnancy or any health condition." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No diagnostica embarazo ni ninguna condición de salud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It doesn't predict your fertile days or your ovulation." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No predice tus días fértiles ni tu ovulación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It doesn't tell you which day your next period starts." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No te dice qué día empieza tu siguiente periodo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It held up." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se sostuvo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is not a contraceptive method." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No es un método anticonceptivo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It looks like there's no data on this device. If you've used Cénit before, on this phone or another, restore your strap history and settings from an iCloud Drive backup." : {
      "comment" : "A message in the alert that appears when the user is prompted to restore",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "It will stop streaming until you re-scan. Your saved data isn't touched." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It will stop streaming until you re-scan. Your saved data isn't touched."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dejará de transmitir hasta que vuelvas a escanear. Tus datos guardados no se tocan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's a comparison of your fitness, not your biological age or a medical diagnosis." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It's a comparison of your fitness, not your biological age or a medical diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es una comparación de tu condición física, no tu edad biológica ni un diagnóstico médico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's a strong association in your data, but not proof of cause. An experiment can promote it to «proven»." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es una asociación fuerte en tus datos, pero no prueba causa. Un experimento puede ascenderla a «probada»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's an association, not a cause. Things like training on the days you already wake up well (then drifting back down), resting when you're tired or sick, or which day of the week you train all play a part." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It's an association, not a cause. Things like training on the days you already wake up well (then drifting back down), resting when you're tired or sick, or which day of the week you train all play a part."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es una asociación, no una causa. Influyen cosas como entrenar justo los días que amaneces bien (y luego «bajar» de forma natural), descansar cuando estás cansado o enfermo, o el día de la semana en que sueles entrenar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
