    },
    "Your Apple Watch estimates VO₂max during outdoor walks and runs with a good GPS signal." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your Apple Watch estimates VO₂max during outdoor walks and runs with a good GPS signal."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu Apple Watch estima el VO₂max en caminatas y carreras al aire libre con buena señal de GPS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Apple Watch estimates VO₂max from your heart rate and pace during brisk outdoor walks and runs with a good GPS signal, so it updates every so often rather than daily. We read where it sits among healthy adults of your age and sex (the FRIEND reference median), and translate that into a plain band. A higher VO₂max is associated with a lower risk of all-cause mortality: it's one of the best-evidenced markers of long-term health." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your Apple Watch estimates VO₂max from your heart rate and pace during brisk outdoor walks and runs with a good GPS signal, so it updates every so often rather than daily. We read where it sits among healthy adults of your age and sex (the FRIEND reference median), and translate that into a plain band. A higher VO₂max is associated with a lower risk of all-cause mortality: it's one of the best-evidenced markers of long-term health."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu Apple Watch estima el VO₂max a partir de tu frecuencia cardiaca y tu ritmo en caminatas y carreras al aire libre con buena señal de GPS, así que se actualiza de vez en cuando, no a diario. Leemos dónde cae entre adultos sanos de tu edad y sexo (la mediana de referencia FRIEND) y lo traducimos en una banda sencilla. Un VO₂max más alto se asocia con menor riesgo de mortalidad por todas las causas, es uno de los marcadores de salud a largo plazo mejor fundamentados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Apple Watch's estimate of your aerobic fitness: how well your body uses oxygen. Higher usually means better cardio shape; it's an estimate, not a lab test." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your Apple Watch's estimate of your aerobic fitness: how well your body uses oxygen. Higher usually means better cardio shape; it's an estimate, not a lab test."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La estimación que hace tu Apple Watch de tu condición aeróbica: qué tan bien usa tu cuerpo el oxígeno. Más alto suele significar mejor forma cardiovascular; es una estimación, no una prueba de laboratorio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your autonomic load for the day: how activated your body is. We compare today's resting heart rate and HRV with your own 30-day baseline and map the combined shift onto a 0–3 scale (0 calm, 1.5 your baseline, 3 highly activated). It's an estimate, not a diagnosis." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your autonomic load for the day: how activated your body is. We compare today's resting heart rate and HRV with your own 30-day baseline and map the combined shift onto a 0–3 scale (0 calm, 1.5 your baseline, 3 highly activated). It's an estimate, not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu carga autonómica del día: qué tan activado está tu cuerpo. Comparamos tu FC en reposo y tu VFC de hoy con tu propia base de 30 días y llevamos el desvío combinado a una escala 0 a 3 (0 calma, 1.5 tu base, 3 muy activado). Es una estimación, no un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your autonomic load today, from 0 to 3. We estimate it by comparing today's resting heart rate and HRV with your own 30-day baseline: a higher-than-usual resting HR and a lower-than-usual HRV both push the number up: classic signs your body is activated." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your autonomic load today, from 0 to 3. We estimate it by comparing today's resting heart rate and HRV with your own 30-day baseline: a higher-than-usual resting HR and a lower-than-usual HRV both push the number up: classic signs your body is activated."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu carga autonómica de hoy, del 0 al 3. La estimamos comparando tu frecuencia cardíaca en reposo y tu HRV con tu propia línea base de 30 días: una FC en reposo más alta de lo normal y una HRV más baja empujan el número hacia arriba, señales clásicas de que tu cuerpo está activado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your autonomic markers are skewed toward stress today. Treat it as a recovery-focused day." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your autonomic markers are skewed toward stress today. Treat it as a recovery-focused day."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tus marcadores autonómicos se inclinan hacia el estrés hoy. Tómalo como un día enfocado en recuperarte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
